# ASan suppressions for the crash-sweep runs (docs/ios-port/SANITIZERS.md). Format: <kind>:<module or function pattern>.
# Added only after the report was read and judged to be noise; every entry says why.

# The SwiftUI launcher window decodes a PDF asset image: CoreGraphics' PDF lexer calls strndup with a length longer than the
# source string (the real strndup stops at the NUL, ASan's interceptor checks the whole count). Apple code, not ours.
interceptor_via_lib:CoreGraphics
